WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.041
- Man, I'm not in any of these highlights.

00:00:02.041 --> 00:00:05.041
It's like nobody appreciates defense and rebounding anymore.

00:00:05.041 --> 00:00:10.625
- [Modern announcer:] Welcome offensive superstar, 
2022 Wardell Stephen Curry!

00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:13.708
Oh! It's…Draymond.

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:16.250
I mean...yeah!

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.916
Welcome to the arena outside of space and time, 
where we have, uh,

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:22.125
Draymond Green!
[Crowd cheering]

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:23.791
- Finally getting some respect.

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:25.500
- [Old-school announcer:] Who should we get? Oh!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.375
Versus two-time Defensive Player of the Year, 
1998 Dennis "The Worm" Rodman!

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:35.416
- Damn, Phil, you ain't gotta be sendin' portals 
to drag me to practice and shit.

00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:37.250
- Rodman?! How's your dictator friend?

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.708
- Oh, Mike? He good.

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:42.000
- [Modern announcer:] A one-on-one matchup between 
two defense-oriented players.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.041
I'm low-key feelin' this.

00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:45.791
- [Old-school announcer:] Game's to 11, win by two.

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:56.500
[Crowd booing]
- [Fan 1:] Where are the points?!

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.125
- [Fan 2:] What is this, soccer?!

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:00.958
- [Old-school announcer:] OK, change of plans. 
Game's now to three, straight up.

00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:02.250
- [Modern announcer:] Rodman shoots...oh!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.500
- Let me show you how the Dubs do it.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.541
- [Modern announcer:] That imaginary backpack 
gets heavier every year.

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.958
- Click. Boom. Rebound.

00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:11.541
Shoot.

00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:13.500
Score.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.458
Aight, I'm gonna need some me time.

00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:17.083
[Club music and horns honking]

00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:20.333
- [Old-school announcer:] Well, looks like Rodman's left the arena 
for Portal Vegas.

00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:23.458
[Crickets]

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.000
[Shoes squeaking]
- [Green:] Don't leave me open.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.791
- [Modern announcer:] And Draymond misses an uncontested two.

00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:29.083
What's this?

00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:33.250
[Crowd cheering]
- Aight, let's get on with this bullshit.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:35.208
I think I married Saturn in Portal Vegas.

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:39.000
Ooh! My little worm.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.625
- [Modern announcer:] Draymond reaching into his sack of tricks.

00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:44.833
- [Old-school announcer:] A Rodman hair change! 
Good luck, Draymond.

00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:45.958
- [Fan:] This is gettin' good!

00:01:45.958 --> 00:01:51.333
- You got this. I ain't about to lose to no bum 
whose sorry-ass team only went 72-10!

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:53.041
- Man, you runnin' your mouth like Barkley.

00:01:53.041 --> 00:01:55.666
- Shit, I do it way better than Barkley.

00:01:57.791 --> 00:01:58.708
- [Modern announcer:] Rodman shoots.

00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:02.291
Rims out. Who will get the rebound?

00:02:02.291 --> 00:02:05.416
One, two, three, four, five tips to secure it!

00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:08.000
- [Old-school announcer:] And Rodman wins, three to two!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.333
- [Rodman laughing]
- [Fans:] Whoa, crushed it! No cap!

00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:13.666
A low-scoring affair and the fans don't even seem pissed.
[Crowd chanting "defense"]

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:14.708
 - [Rodman:] Hey, I need a light.

00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:17.791
- [Old-school announcer:] This is not how you should 
treat the media!

00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:19.750
- [Fan:] I love defense, woo!

00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:24.708
- Ah, I finally found fans who appreciate my 
defensive-minded approach to the game.

00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:25.666
That's enough for me.

00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:28.958
- [Warriors fan:] Hey everyone! Steph is shootin' threes from the parking lot!

00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:30.000
- Portal, take me back!

